GIVEN `the regulation number` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`reg 3(1) the measures required by a regulation are enhanced customer due diligence measures` MEANS
    IF `the regulation number` AT LEAST 33 AND `the regulation number` AT MOST 35
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "means the customer due diligence measures required under regulations 33 to 35"

-- src:94 | “ongoing monitoring” (except where the context otherwise requires) means at least the measures described in regulation 28(11);
@ref reg 3(1) "ongoing monitoring" (src:94)
GIVEN `the context otherwise requires` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the measures include scrutiny of transactions as described in regulation 28(11)(a)` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the measures include reviews of existing records and keeping documents or information up to date as described in regulation 28(11)(b)` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`reg 3(1) the measures are ongoing monitoring` MEANS
    IF `the context otherwise requires`
    THEN NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "(except where the context otherwise requires)"
    ELSE IF `the measures include scrutiny of transactions as described in regulation 28(11)(a)` AND `the measures include reviews of existing records and keeping documents or information up to date as described in regulation 28(11)(b)`
        THEN JUST TRUE
        ELSE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "means at least the measures described in regulation 28(11)"; a lower bound, and the text does not say fewer is not ongoing monitoring

-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- “enactment”: an "includes" list
-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
DECLARE `reg 3(1) Source of an enactment` IS ONE OF
    `subordinate legislation`
    `an Act of the Scottish Parliament`
    `an instrument made under an Act of the Scottish Parliament`
    `a Measure or Act of the National Assembly for Wales`
    `an instrument made under a Measure or Act of the National Assembly for Wales`
    `Northern Ireland legislation`
    `an instrument made under Northern Ireland legislation`
    `another source of enactments`

-- src:57 | “enactment” includes—
-- src:58 | an enactment contained in subordinate legislation;
-- src:59 | an enactment contained in, or in an instrument made under, an Act of the Scottish Parliament;
-- src:60 | an enactment contained in, or in an instrument made under, a Measure or Act of the National Assembly for Wales; and
-- src:61 | an enactment contained in, or in an instrument made under, Northern Ireland legislation;
@ref reg 3(1) "enactment" (src:57-61)
GIVEN source IS A `reg 3(1) Source of an enactment`
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`reg 3(1) an enactment contained in the source is an enactment` MEANS
    CONSIDER source
    WHEN `subordinate legislation` THEN JUST TRUE -- "includes an enactment contained in subordinate legislation"
    WHEN `an Act of the Scottish Parliament` THEN JUST TRUE -- "includes an enactment contained in ... an Act of the Scottish Parliament"
    WHEN `an instrument made under an Act of the Scottish Parliament` THEN JUST TRUE -- "includes an enactment contained in ... an instrument made under an Act of the Scottish Parliament"
    WHEN `a Measure or Act of the National Assembly for Wales` THEN JUST TRUE -- "includes an enactment contained in ... a Measure or Act of the National Assembly for Wales"
    WHEN `an instrument made under a Measure or Act of the National Assembly for Wales` THEN JUST TRUE -- "includes an enactment contained in ... an instrument made under a Measure or Act of the National Assembly for Wales"
    WHEN `Northern Ireland legislation` THEN JUST TRUE -- "includes an enactment contained in ... Northern Ireland legislation"
    WHEN `an instrument made under Northern Ireland legislation` THEN JUST TRUE -- "includes an enactment contained in ... an instrument made under Northern Ireland legislation"
    WHEN `another source of enactments` THEN NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (includes): "includes" does not close the list

-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
