DECLARE `reg 3(1) Role in an entity` IS ONE OF
    `a director`
    `a secretary of a body corporate`
    `a chief executive`
    `a member of the committee of management`
    `an individual who is a controller of the body`
    `an officer of the unincorporated association`
    `a member of the governing body of the unincorporated association`
    `a partner`
    `a manager of the partnership`
    `a secretary or similar officer of the partnership`
    `another role`

-- src:89 | in relation to a body corporate, means—
-- src:90 | a director, secretary, chief executive, member of the committee of management, or a person purporting to act in such a capacity, or
-- src:91 | an individual who is a controller of the body, or a person purporting to act as a controller;
@ref reg 3(1) "officer" in relation to a body corporate (src:89-91)
GIVEN role IS A `reg 3(1) Role in an entity`
      `the person purports to act in such a capacity` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`reg 3(1) officer of a body corporate` MEANS
        `the person purports to act in such a capacity`
     OR (CONSIDER role
         WHEN `a director` THEN TRUE
         WHEN `a secretary of a body corporate` THEN TRUE
         WHEN `a chief executive` THEN TRUE
         WHEN `a member of the committee of management` THEN TRUE
         WHEN `an individual who is a controller of the body` THEN TRUE
         OTHERWISE FALSE)

-- src:92 | in relation to an unincorporated association, means any officer of the association or any member of its governing body, or a person purporting to act in such a capacity; and
@ref reg 3(1) "officer" in relation to an unincorporated association (src:92)
