      `the person purports to act in such a capacity` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`reg 3(1) officer of an unincorporated association` MEANS
        `the person purports to act in such a capacity`
     OR (CONSIDER role
         WHEN `an officer of the unincorporated association` THEN TRUE
         WHEN `a member of the governing body of the unincorporated association` THEN TRUE
         OTHERWISE FALSE)

-- src:93 | in relation to a partnership, means a partner, and any manager, secretary or similar officer of the partnership, or a person purporting to act in such a capacity;
@ref reg 3(1) "officer" in relation to a partnership (src:93)
GIVEN role IS A `reg 3(1) Role in an entity`
      `the person purports to act in such a capacity` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`reg 3(1) officer of a partnership` MEANS
        `the person purports to act in such a capacity`
     OR (CONSIDER role
         WHEN `a partner` THEN TRUE
         WHEN `a manager of the partnership` THEN TRUE
         WHEN `a secretary or similar officer of the partnership` THEN TRUE
         OTHERWISE FALSE)

