    ELSE CONSIDER form
        WHEN `a company` THEN IF `reg 3(1) officer of a body corporate` role `the person purports to act in such a capacity` THEN JUST TRUE ELSE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "in relation to a body corporate, means" the listed persons
        WHEN `a limited liability partnership` THEN IF `reg 3(1) officer of a body corporate` role `the person purports to act in such a capacity` THEN JUST TRUE ELSE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "in relation to a body corporate, means" the listed persons
        WHEN `a body corporate of another kind` THEN IF `reg 3(1) officer of a body corporate` role `the person purports to act in such a capacity` THEN JUST TRUE ELSE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "in relation to a body corporate, means" the listed persons
        WHEN `an unincorporated association` THEN IF `reg 3(1) officer of an unincorporated association` role `the person purports to act in such a capacity` THEN JUST TRUE ELSE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "in relation to an unincorporated association, means" the listed persons
        WHEN `a partnership other than a limited liability partnership` THEN IF `reg 3(1) officer of a partnership` role `the person purports to act in such a capacity` THEN JUST TRUE ELSE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "in relation to a partnership, means" the listed persons
        OTHERWISE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (silent): the definition speaks only of a body corporate, an unincorporated association and a partnership

